{"2686570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Waltz and Jam", "steam_appid": 2686570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/7261d21367f39a6955979ef83bd40da3.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waltz and Jam is an action-adventure platformer following Waltz, a pure-hearted soul, and Jam, a lovable shape-shifting dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the afterlife where the Seven Deadly Sins are reimagined as seven vivid realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles woven into the world around you, topple mighty bosses, and complete your ticket to enter Uptown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/dd55e462ff3eb6f24a9e80399ee56e76.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/dd55e462ff3eb6f24a9e80399ee56e76.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/dd55e462ff3eb6f24a9e80399ee56e76.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JAM, YOUR BEST FRIEND IN THE AFTERLIFE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jam is far more than an adorable pup. He's Waltz's dearest friend and truest partner on this journey beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform Jam into a Jam Water Ball to bounce and splash, a Jam Trampoline to soar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix Jam's wonderfully wacky transformations with Waltz’s toy skills, and together nothing stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Jam by your side, the sky's the limit, no puzzle too tricky, no darkness too deep to brave together.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/49080d1c5a36a5e807af1ea8f446e435.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/49080d1c5a36a5e807af1ea8f446e435.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/49080d1c5a36a5e807af1ea8f446e435.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CURIOUS TOYS, NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the worlds are toys, each waiting for someone to pick them up, each hiding a peculiar power that aids Waltz on his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put them to clever use to trigger strange contraptions, open hidden passages, and send pesky foes flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new toy unlocks another way to unravel the world, and the path you've been searching for might be hiding right under your nose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/5a32610280ef7b6b36e1cc3260d99a35.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/5a32610280ef7b6b36e1cc3260d99a35.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/5a32610280ef7b6b36e1cc3260d99a35.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEVEN SINS, SEVEN STORYBOOK WORLDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the mysterious Low through seven handcrafted worlds, each reimagining one of the Deadly Sins through its own peculiar hue and mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a restaurant clattering with chaos to a castle tangled in light and shadow, to a desert that rolls on like an endless sea, every realm turns like a page in a hand-painted storybook, each with a look all its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the tales and secrets tucked into every corner, and solve each world's puzzles to unearth its treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't let the pretty scenery fool you! Something spookier always lurks just beyond the page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/aae920c397e726c28a507b0446c9b502.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/25f510148128ad68fa5be9aed191cf6f.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/25f510148128ad68fa5be9aed191cf6f.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/25f510148128ad68fa5be9aed191cf6f.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BOSS BATTLES, EVERY TALE ENDS IN A TRIAL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each of the seven worlds waits a towering boss, swallowed whole by the sin it embodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read its every move, find an opening, and use your toys, Jam's transformations, and even the environment itself to turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer each colossal trial and claim its stamp, and with every victory Waltz and Jam draw one step closer to Uptown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/c633f7efd765673ff2d89b07ccee2533.avif?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=111 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/7261d21367f39a6955979ef83bd40da3.webp?t=1787739066\" width=620 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.poster.avif?t=1787739066\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.webm?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686570/extras/45be153847f650cb8790d6b2352d0518.mp4?t=1787739066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waltz and Jam is an action-adventure platformer following Waltz, a pure-hearted soul, and Jam, a lovable shape-shifting dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the aft